      ],
      "text": "11 facts. Same prompt. Same idea. Completely different output, based on whether AI can generate a clip or create a usable scene.\n\nYou understood that native 4K matters, and stopped treating every AI video as the same quality.\n\nYou saw the audio-video joint generation, and stopped",
      "url": "https://x.com/Hey_leoAi/status/2122772710988390426"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "2085228096823967744",
      "created_at": "2026-11-17T19:23:47.000Z",
      "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
        "2122772708115259460"
      ],
      "id": "2122772708115259460",
      "in_reply_to_user_id": "2085228096823967744",
      "public_metrics": {
        "bookmark_count": 0,
        "impression_count": 38,
        "like_count": 5,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "reply_count": 1,
        "retweet_count": 0
      },
      "referenced_tweets": [
        {
          "id": "2122772705288315326",
          "type": "replied_to"
        }
      ],
      "text": "11. The biggest lesson is this:\n\nSeedance 2.5 4K is not just about sharper resolution.\n\nIt is about making AI video more controllable, more consistent, and more production-ready.\n\nThe combination of native 4K, synchronized audio, reference control, editing, and 30-second",
      "url": "https://x.com/Hey_leoAi/status/2122772708115259460"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "2085228096823967744",
      "created_at": "2026-11-17T19:23:46.000Z",
      "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
        "2122772705288315326"
      ],
      "id": "2122772705288315326",
      "in_reply_to_user_id": "2085228096823967744",
      "public_metrics": {
        "bookmark_count": 0,
        "impression_count": 16,
        "like_count": 5,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "reply_count": 1,
        "retweet_count": 0
      },
      "referenced_tweets": [
        {
          "id": "2122772702373298570",
          "type": "replied_to"
        }
      ],
      "text": "10. The tenth thing to understand is that Seedance still has limits.\n\nSeedance 2.5 4K is powerful, but it is not magic.\n\nComplex physical interactions, precise lip-sync, long-form continuity, and highly specific brand requirements can still require human review and editing.\n\nThe",
      "url": "https://x.com/Hey_leoAi/status/2122772705288315326"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "2085228096823967744",
      "created_at": "2026-11-17T19:23:46.000Z",
      "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
        "2122772702373298570"
      ],
      "id": "2122772702373298570",
      "in_reply_to_user_id": "2085228096823967744",
      "public_metrics": {
        "bookmark_count": 0,
        "impression_count": 14,
        "like_count": 5,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "reply_count": 1,
        "retweet_count": 0
      },
      "referenced_tweets": [
        {
          "id": "2122772699764392324",
          "type": "replied_to"
        }
      ],
      "text": "9. The ninth thing to understand is that this changes creative workflows.\n\nA creator can now:\n\nWrite a prompt\n\nAdd product photos, character references, or a style guide\n\nGenerate a 30-second scene with audio\n\nEdit specific parts without reshooting everything\n\nExport in 4K for",
      "url": "https://x.com/Hey_leoAi/status/2122772702373298570"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "2085228096823967744",
      "created_at": "2026-11-17T19:23:45.000Z",
      "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
        "2122772699764392324"
      ],
      "id": "2122772699764392324",
      "in_reply_to_user_id": "2085228096823967744",
      "public_metrics": {
        "bookmark_count": 0,
        "impression_count": 14,
        "like_count": 5,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "reply_count": 1,
        "retweet_count": 0
      },
      "referenced_tweets": [
        {
          "id": "2122772696627126698",
          "type": "replied_to"
        }
      ],
      "text": "8. The eighth thing to understand is that it can extend videos too.\n\nSeedance 2.5 supports video extension, allowing creators to continue a clip rather than starting from scratch.\n\nCapCut says its beta Long Video Mode can extend Seedance output to 180 seconds while trying to",
      "url": "https://x.com/Hey_leoAi/status/2122772699764392324"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "2085228096823967744",
      "created_at": "2026-11-17T19:23:44.000Z",
      "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
        "2122772696627126698"
      ],
      "id": "2122772696627126698",
      "in_reply_to_user_id": "2085228096823967744",
      "public_metrics": {
        "bookmark_count": 0,
        "impression_count": 19,
        "like_count": 5,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "reply_count": 1,
        "retweet_count": 0
      },
      "referenced_tweets": [
        {
          "id": "2122772692638290005",
          "type": "replied_to"
        }
      ],
      "text": "7. The seventh thing to understand is that Seedance can edit video, not only generate it.\n\nSeedance 2.5 supports localized editing: changing a product, background, character, or visual region without regenerating the entire clip.\n\nIt can preserve the original movement, lighting, https://t.co/u8l4qA5ATL",
      "url": "https://x.com/Hey_leoAi/status/2122772696627126698"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "2085228096823967744",
      "created_at": "2026-11-17T19:23:43.000Z",
      "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
        "2122772692638290005"
      ],
      "id": "2122772692638290005",
      "in_reply_to_user_id": "2085228096823967744",
      "public_metrics": {
        "bookmark_count": 0,
        "impression_count": 19,
        "like_count": 5,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "reply_count": 1,
        "retweet_count": 0
      },
      "referenced_tweets": [
        {
          "id": "2122772689807143389",
          "type": "replied_to"
        }
      ],
      "text": "6. The sixth thing to understand is that consistency is the real challenge in AI video.\n\nA video is not just one image.\n\nIt needs the same character, lighting, wardrobe, product, and visual style across every frame.\n\nSeedance 2.5 is designed to maintain character, outfit, prop,",
      "url": "https://x.com/Hey_leoAi/status/2122772692638290005"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "2085228096823967744",
      "created_at": "2026-11-17T19:23:43.000Z",
      "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
        "2122772689807143389"
      ],
      "id": "2122772689807143389",
      "in_reply_to_user_id": "2085228096823967744",
      "public_metrics": {
        "bookmark_count": 0,
        "impression_count": 23,
        "like_count": 5,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "reply_count": 1,
        "retweet_count": 0
      },
      "referenced_tweets": [
        {
          "id": "2122772686518763944",
          "type": "replied_to"
        }
      ],
      "text": "5. The fifth thing to understand is that Seedance supports reference-based creation.\n\nSeedance 2.5 can use up to 50 multimodal references in a single prompt, including images, video clips, audio, and 3D white models.\n\nYou can reference a character’s face, clothing, product,",
      "url": "https://x.com/Hey_leoAi/status/2122772689807143389"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "2085228096823967744",
      "created_at": "2026-11-17T19:23:42.000Z",
      "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
        "2122772686518763944"
      ],
      "id": "2122772686518763944",
      "in_reply_to_user_id": "2085228096823967744",
      "public_metrics": {
        "bookmark_count": 0,
        "impression_count": 18,
        "like_count": 5,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "reply_count": 1,
        "retweet_count": 0
      },
      "referenced_tweets": [
        {
          "id": "2122772682345419157",
          "type": "replied_to"
        }
      ],
      "text": "4. The fourth thing to understand is that 30 seconds is a major upgrade.\n\nSeedance 2.5 can generate clips up to 30 seconds in a single generation.\n\nThat is enough time for a short product ad, a scene with dialogue, a mini-story, or a multi-shot social video.\n\nEarlier models often https://t.co/ExYAmlddrk",
      "url": "https://x.com/Hey_leoAi/status/2122772686518763944"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "2085228096823967744",
      "created_at": "2026-11-17T19:23:41.000Z",
      "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
        "2122772682345419157"
      ],
      "id": "2122772682345419157",
      "in_reply_to_user_id": "2085228096823967744",
      "public_metrics": {
        "bookmark_count": 0,
        "impression_count": 17,
        "like_count": 5,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "reply_count": 1,
        "retweet_count": 0
      },
      "referenced_tweets": [
        {
          "id": "2122772679422070848",
          "type": "replied_to"
        }
      ],
      "text": "3. The third thing to understand is that Seedance generates audio with the video.\n\nSeedance 2.5 is an audio-video joint generation model.\n\nIt can create synchronized dialogue, sound effects, ambient sound, and music alongside the visuals.\n\n“You do not get a silent video and then",
      "url": "https://x.com/Hey_leoAi/status/2122772682345419157"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "2085228096823967744",
      "created_at": "2026-11-17T19:23:40.000Z",
      "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
        "2122772679422070848"
      ],
      "id": "2122772679422070848",
      "in_reply_to_user_id": "2085228096823967744",
      "public_metrics": {
        "bookmark_count": 0,
        "impression_count": 44,
        "like_count": 5,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "reply_count": 1,
        "retweet_count": 0
      },
      "referenced_tweets": [
        {
          "id": "2122772676557316394",
          "type": "replied_to"
        }
      ],
      "text": "2. The second thing to understand is that the 4K output is native, not upscaled.\n\nSeedance 2.5 4K renders at 3840 × 2160 resolution.\n\nThat means the detail is generated at full 4K rather than being enlarged from a lower-resolution video.\n\nThe output is delivered in 10-bit color,",
      "url": "https://x.com/Hey_leoAi/status/2122772679422070848"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "2085228096823967744",
      "created_at": "2026-11-17T19:23:39.000Z",
      "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
        "2122772676557316394"
      ],
      "id": "2122772676557316394",
      "in_reply_to_user_id": "2085228096823967744",
      "public_metrics": {
        "bookmark_count": 0,
        "impression_count": 89,
        "like_count": 5,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "reply_count": 1,
        "retweet_count": 0
      },
      "referenced_tweets": [
        {
          "id": "2122772673394815307",
          "type": "replied_to"
        }
      ],
      "text": "1. The first thing to understand is that Seedance 2.5 4K is not just another AI video generator.\n\nMost AI video tools create short clips that look impressive for a few seconds.\n\nSeedance 2.5 is built for longer storytelling.\n\nIt can generate 4 to 30 seconds of video in one pass,",
      "url": "https://x.com/Hey_leoAi/status/2122772676557316394"
    }
